<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background: #0f2a1d; color: #fff; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
    .container { text-align: center; padding: 40px; }
    h1 { font-size: 3.5em; color: #4caf50; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .badge { display: inline-block; background: #4caf50; color: #fff; padding: 10px 32px; border-radius: 24px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.2em; margin: 20px 0; }
    p { font-size: 1.2em; color: #a0c0b0; margin: 8px 0; }
    .links { margin-top: 40px; display: flex; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
    .links a { background: #1a4a2a; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 12px; font-weight: 500; transition: background 0.2s; }
    .links a:hover { background: #2a6a3a; }
    .footer { margin-top: 60px; color: #507060; font-size: 0.9em; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>FieldFlow</h1>
    <div class="badge">&#9679; Running</div>
    <p>Agri-input Traceability &amp; Advisory Platform</p>
    <p>Server is live on port <%= port %></p>
    <div class="links">
      <a href="/health">Health Check</a>
      <a href="/auth/login">Login</a>
      <a href="/dashboard">Dealer Portal</a>
      <a href="/supplier-portal">Supplier Portal</a>
      <a href="/admin-portal">Admin Portal</a>
      <a href="/farmer-portal">Farmer Portal</a>
      <a href="/verify-page">Verify Product</a>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">Built for smallholder farmers &middot; South Asia</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
